    <chapter xml:id="ch-online-assignments">
      <title>Assignments</title>
      <introduction>
        <p>
          The nine assignments. You can check your work by entering your
          answers in the provided boxes: type an answer, press
          <q>Check Me</q>, and check as often as you like. This lets you
          verify your final answers before submitting the complete solution
          to be graded by the grader. The worked solutions are in
          <xref ref="ch-assignment-solutions" text="title"/>.
        </p>
      </introduction>
      <xi:include href="hw1-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw2-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw3-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw4-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw5-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw6-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw7-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw8-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw9-online.ptx" />
    </chapter>

    <chapter xml:id="ch-assignment-solutions">
      <title>Assignments with Solutions</title>
      <introduction>
        <p>
          The same nine assignments, each problem followed by a complete
          worked solution. The solutions will be posted after the due date
          of each assignment. To work the problems with your answers checked
          automatically, use <xref ref="ch-online-assignments" text="title"/>.
        </p>
      </introduction>
      <xi:include href="hw1-solutions.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw2-solutions.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw3-solutions.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw4-solutions.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw5-solutions.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw6-solutions.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw7-solutions.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw8-solutions.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="hw9-solutions.ptx" />
    </chapter>

    <chapter xml:id="ch-review-practice">
      <title>Review Problems for Practice</title>
      <introduction>
        <p>
          The review problem sets, questions only: answers are checked
          automatically, but the only response is right or
          wrong<mdash/>no hints, no worked feedback, and no solutions
          anywhere in this chapter. The problems with their complete
          solutions are in <xref ref="ch-review-solutions" text="title"/>.
        </p>
      </introduction>
      <xi:include href="review3-practice.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="review4-practice.ptx" />
    </chapter>

    <chapter xml:id="ch-review-solutions">
      <title>Review Problems with Solutions</title>
      <introduction>
        <p>
          The same review problem sets with a complete worked solution
          printed below every problem. To try the problems on their own,
          with your answers checked automatically and no solutions in
          sight, use <xref ref="ch-review-practice" text="title"/>.
        </p>
      </introduction>
      <xi:include href="review3-online.ptx" />
      <xi:include href="review4-online.ptx" />
    </chapter>

  </book>

